<title>USA: AMB Financial to buy back 4 pct of shares.</title>
<headline>AMB Financial to buy back 4 pct of shares.</headline>
<dateline>MUNSTER, Ind. 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>AMB Financial Corp said Monday it intends to repurchase about four percent of the company's outstanding shares of common stock over a six-month period.</p>
<p>The shares will be purchased from time to time, at prevailing market prices.  They will be allocated in the company's &quot;recognition and retention plan,&quot; a stock plan primarily for executives, the company said.</p>
<p>As of September 30, AMB Financial had 1,124,125 shares outstanding, the company said.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
